{
  "FormatVersion": 7,
  "Name": "Los Ninos",
  "Comment": "Verified against a MIDI transcription of the original (115 BPM): all 24 steps play, in the two accent classes the Korg SQ-10 accent row gave the original - the loud/long class carries the accent flag here, the ACCENT knob sets how hot it gets. The three high fills (C#3/G#2/Bb2) sit between the classes in the original (shorter and quieter than the accents) and stay plain here. The original jumps up an octave to Bb2 on step 13; this preset deliberately leaves that out (a matter of taste - to restore it, set step 13 to Bb2).",
